# Simulation output. Two roots, deliberately separate: Output/ is the data
# (run archives, the results-matrix batch, the PMP reference cache) and
# Output_Plots/ is every figure drawn from it. Both are regenerable, except
# pmp_reference.npz which is force-added because rebuilding it costs an hour.
Tese/src/Output/
Tese/src/Output_Plots/

# The nested tree that a cwd-relative SAVE_PLOTS_DIR used to create when main.py
# was run from inside Tese/src. It got committed once; ignored so it cannot
# again.
Tese/src/Tese/
